  <a class="brand" href={home}><img src={`${home}icon.png`} width="28" height="28" alt="" /><span>Shark</span></a>
  <p>A native Mac file manager.</p>
  <div><a href={`${home}features/`}>All features</a><a href="https://github.com/andronasef/shark">Source code</a><a href="https://github.com/andronasef/shark/releases">Releases</a><a href="https://github.com/andronasef/shark/issues">Report an issue</a></div>
</footer>
